Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:07:31.18,HEADB,,0,0,0,,{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}伊埃拉 {\r\fnBarlow Condensed SemiBold\c&HFFFFFF&\fs44}6-3 5-7 6-4{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC} 麦克纳莉 · 赛后新闻发布会
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.84,0:00:03.76,EN,,0,0,0,,Okay, we'll go ahead and get started.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.84,0:00:03.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,好 我们开始吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.76,0:00:05.44,EN,,0,0,0,,Alex, what a win tonight
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.76,0:00:05.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,亚历克斯 今晚这场赢得漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.44,0:00:07.28,EN,,0,0,0,,and an amazing atmosphere out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.44,0:00:07.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,现场气氛也太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.28,0:00:08.88,EN,,0,0,0,,Um, it was a really hard-fought battle
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.28,0:00:08.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,这是一场苦战
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.88,0:00:09.92,EN,,0,0,0,,against a great opponent.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.88,0:00:09.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,对手也很强
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.92,0:00:12.00,EN,,0,0,0,,Just give us your keys to the match today.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.92,0:00:12.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,说说今天这场的关键吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.00,0:00:14.40,EN,,0,0,0,,Yeah, uh, thanks for waiting, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.00,0:00:14.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,谢谢大家等着
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.40,0:00:17.44,EN,,0,0,0,,Um, I think it was it
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.40,0:00:17.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,我是说
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.44,0:00:20.40,EN,,0,0,0,,was a really tough match today.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.44,0:00:20.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,今天这场真的很难打
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.40,0:00:22.00,EN,,0,0,0,,Um, for many reasons.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.40,0:00:22.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,原因有好几个
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.00,0:00:23.44,EN,,0,0,0,,one being also that Caty
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.00,0:00:23.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,其中一个是麦克纳莉
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.44,0:00:26.24,EN,,0,0,0,,is such a big fighter and I think she's got
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.44,0:00:26.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,她太能拼了 而且
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.24,0:00:28.48,EN,,0,0,0,,definitely some some good weapons
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.24,0:00:28.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,她确实有些厉害的武器
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.48,0:00:34.04,EN,,0,0,0,,and and yeah, it was a tight was a tight one.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.48,0:00:34.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,这场打得很胶着
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.20,0:00:37.76,EN,,0,0,0,,Alex, congratulations on an incredible win.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.20,0:00:37.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,亚历克斯 恭喜这场精彩的胜利
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.76,0:00:40.24,EN,,0,0,0,,After the match, you kind of just sat there
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.76,0:00:40.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,赛后你坐在那儿
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.24,0:00:41.68,EN,,0,0,0,,and just
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.24,0:00:41.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,就那样
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.68,0:00:43.20,EN,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Can you explain that moment
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.68,0:00:43.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,能说说那一刻吗
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.20,0:00:45.04,EN,,0,0,0,,and just what was going through your mind
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.20,0:00:45.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,你当时在想什么
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.04,0:00:45.92,EN,,0,0,0,,and
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.04,0:00:45.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,还有
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.92,0:00:46.88,EN,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.92,0:00:46.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.88,0:00:49.12,EN,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Um I think this match
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.88,0:00:49.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,我觉得这场
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.12,0:00:51.84,EN,,0,0,0,,was was really challenging for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.12,0:00:51.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,对我来说真的很有挑战
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.84,0:00:54.56,EN,,0,0,0,,I think the whole two weeks I guess
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.84,0:00:54.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,这整整两周
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.56,0:00:56.80,EN,,0,0,0,,have been very challenging
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.56,0:00:56.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,都很有挑战
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.80,0:00:59.44,EN,,0,0,0,,and each match that I've played
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.80,0:00:59.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,我打的每一场
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.44,0:01:03.52,EN,,0,0,0,,has presented its unique set of challenges.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.44,0:01:03.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,都有各自不同的难题
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.52,0:01:08.40,EN,,0,0,0,,Um yeah, today obviously was really close
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.52,0:01:08.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,今天这场确实很胶着
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.40,0:01:11.68,EN,,0,0,0,,and I think you know like I'm I'm
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.40,0:01:11.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,我
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.68,0:01:14.88,EN,,0,0,0,,really of course I'm feeling the effects
