Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.88,0:01:16.56,EN,,0,0,0,,of you know just everything
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.88,0:01:16.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,这一切带来的影响
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.56,0:01:18.16,EN,,0,0,0,,and I think I'm really doing
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.56,0:01:18.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,我真的在尽力
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.16,0:01:19.44,EN,,0,0,0,,my best like I said on court
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.16,0:01:19.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,就像我在场上说的那样
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.44,0:01:23.84,EN,,0,0,0,,to um you know to stay professional
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.44,0:01:23.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,保持专业
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.84,0:01:26.00,EN,,0,0,0,,and stick to what I know but everything
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.84,0:01:26.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,做我熟悉的事 但这一切
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.00,0:01:27.84,EN,,0,0,0,,of course like this past two weeks I've
