Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.84,0:01:30.88,EN,,0,0,0,,been feeling emotions so extremely
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.84,0:01:30.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,情绪一直很强烈
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.88,0:01:32.96,EN,,0,0,0,,because of the the circumstances
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.88,0:01:32.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,因为这些经历
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.96,0:01:34.80,EN,,0,0,0,,which is which is a great thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.96,0:01:34.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,这其实是件好事
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.80,0:01:37.04,EN,,0,0,0,,You know, I love I'm I think I'm quite a
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.80,0:01:37.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,我觉得我是个
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.04,0:01:38.48,EN,,0,0,0,,sentimental person.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.04,0:01:38.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,挺重感情的人
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.48,0:01:39.60,EN,,0,0,0,,Um but at the same time,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.48,0:01:39.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,但同时
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.60,0:01:41.76,EN,,0,0,0,,it's just kind of like finding that balance.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.60,0:01:41.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,也在找一个平衡
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.76,0:01:43.92,EN,,0,0,0,,So, I think um I'm really proud
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.76,0:01:43.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以我挺为自己骄傲
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.92,0:01:45.12,EN,,0,0,0,,of how I handled today
