Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.12,0:01:48.08,EN,,0,0,0,,and and and what I did on court.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.12,0:01:48.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,场上的表现也是
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.08,0:01:49.68,EN,,0,0,0,,Yeah, Alex, there there were so many times
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.08,0:01:49.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,亚历克斯 这场好多次
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.68,0:01:51.28,EN,,0,0,0,,during the match where you were tested,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.68,0:01:51.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,你都被逼到了极限
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.28,0:01:52.56,EN,,0,0,0,,you know, you had to come up
