Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.96,0:01:56.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,那种时候心里在想什么
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.72,0:01:57.60,EN,,0,0,0,,when you're fighting back
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.72,0:01:57.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,当你从落后的比分里
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.60,0:01:59.68,EN,,0,0,0,,from those early deficits and games?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.60,0:01:59.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,往回拼的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.68,0:02:03.20,EN,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I think I need I try
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.68,0:02:03.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,我会
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.20,0:02:05.28,EN,,0,0,0,,to focus more on factual things.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.20,0:02:05.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,更专注在事实上
