Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.24,0:02:09.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,有很多外部因素
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.44,0:02:11.92,EN,,0,0,0,,but there are things that also I can control
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.44,0:02:11.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,但也有我能控制的部分
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.92,0:02:13.92,EN,,0,0,0,,and I'm I was aware of the situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.92,0:02:13.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,我很清楚当时的局面
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.92,0:02:15.76,EN,,0,0,0,,I know that she was playing well.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.92,0:02:15.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,我知道她打得很好
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.76,0:02:16.72,EN,,0,0,0,,Um I know that I
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.76,0:02:16.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,我也知道我
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.72,0:02:19.12,EN,,0,0,0,,was missing certain balls here and there.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.72,0:02:19.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,有些球没处理好
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.12,0:02:22.40,EN,,0,0,0,,So I tried to just play the point better
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.12,0:02:22.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以我就想把这一分打
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.40,0:02:23.44,EN,,0,0,0,,than the point before.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.40,0:02:23.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,得比上一分更好
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.44,0:02:24.72,EN,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.44,0:02:24.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.72,0:02:25.68,EN,,0,0,0,,Hi Alex, well done.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.72,0:02:25.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,你好 亚历克斯 打得漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.68,0:02:28.00,EN,,0,0,0,,So, the the Blue Dinosaur super fan
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.68,0:02:28.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,那个蓝色恐龙的超级粉丝
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.00,0:02:29.12,EN,,0,0,0,,was back today.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.00,0:02:29.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,今天又来了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.12,0:02:30.48,EN,,0,0,0,,Oh my gosh.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.12,0:02:30.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,天呐
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.48,0:02:32.40,EN,,0,0,0,,Oh my god. How just talk
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.48,0:02:32.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,天呐 说说
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.40,0:02:33.36,EN,,0,0,0,,about your new super fan
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.40,0:02:33.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,你这位新粉丝吧
