Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.88,0:02:36.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,整场比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.08,0:02:38.00,EN,,0,0,0,,You know, today I didn't see him
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.08,0:02:38.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,其实今天我没看见他
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.00,0:02:38.72,EN,,0,0,0,,in the crowd.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.00,0:02:38.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,在人群里
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.72,0:02:40.48,EN,,0,0,0,,I knew he I know he was there.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.72,0:02:40.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,但我知道他在
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.48,0:02:42.08,EN,,0,0,0,,People told me he was there.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.48,0:02:42.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,有人跟我说他来了
