Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.24,0:02:45.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,第一晚我第一次看见他的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.52,0:02:48.32,EN,,0,0,0,,when I first saw him the first night.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.52,0:02:48.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,真的太好笑了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.32,0:02:49.68,EN,,0,0,0,,Amazing. And I think it
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.32,0:02:49.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,真是 我是说
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.68,0:02:50.96,EN,,0,0,0,,was just I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.68,0:02:50.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,说不上来
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.96,0:02:53.92,EN,,0,0,0,,It just it was like such a light funny spin
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.96,0:02:53.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,就是给大家支持我的方式
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.92,0:02:57.68,EN,,0,0,0,,to kind of like how how people support me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.92,0:02:57.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,添了一种轻松好玩的调调
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.68,0:03:00.24,EN,,0,0,0,,It just comes out in very unique ways
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.68,0:03:00.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,每个人支持的方式都很不一样
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.24,0:03:04.60,EN,,0,0,0,,and I think he's really stood out.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.24,0:03:04.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,他这个真的很突出
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.20,0:03:06.64,EN,,0,0,0,,Hi Alex. Well done tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.20,0:03:06.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,你好 亚历克斯 今晚打得好
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.64,0:03:08.24,EN,,0,0,0,,I noticed in the third set
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.64,0:03:08.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,我注意到决胜盘
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.24,0:03:10.40,EN,,0,0,0,,after you won a point you asked the crowd
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.24,0:03:10.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,你赢下一分之后让观众
