Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.40,0:03:11.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,喊得更大声
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.52,0:03:13.36,EN,,0,0,0,,You you were them on to cheer.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.52,0:03:13.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,你在带动他们喊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.36,0:03:15.12,EN,,0,0,0,,Players have talked about how a crowd
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.36,0:03:15.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,有球员说过观众
