Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.12,0:03:18.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,今晚你有这种感觉吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.56,0:03:20.56,EN,,0,0,0,,especially in the third set, that the crowd
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.56,0:03:20.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,尤其是决胜盘 观众
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.56,0:03:22.56,EN,,0,0,0,,was really even more supportive than you
