Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.64,0:03:33.84,EN,,0,0,0,,of like I I was hyped so I wanted to kind
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.64,0:03:33.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,我很兴奋 就想
