Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.92,0:03:39.52,EN,,0,0,0,,in their energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.92,0:03:39.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,借一下他们的能量
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.52,0:03:42.56,EN,,0,0,0,,Um but I think it was I I think it
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.52,0:03:42.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,我觉得那
