Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.16,0:03:50.80,EN,,0,0,0,,normally I try to just be indifferent
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.16,0:03:50.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,平时我尽量表现得平静
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.80,0:03:52.48,EN,,0,0,0,,and kind of like, you know, but I think
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.80,0:03:52.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,但我是说
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.48,0:03:57.20,EN,,0,0,0,,that point was specifically um I'm sorry,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.48,0:03:57.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,那一分特别一点 抱歉
