Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.16,0:04:03.28,EN,,0,0,0,,It was Yeah, I wanted that point.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.16,0:04:03.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,就是 我太想拿下那一分了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.28,0:04:05.92,EN,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.28,0:04:05.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.92,0:04:08.56,EN,,0,0,0,,Alex, oh, you had such a nice warm hug
