Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.48,0:04:44.16,EN,,0,0,0,,I also wanted to ask how tired you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.48,0:04:44.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,我还想问你有多累
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.16,0:04:45.68,EN,,0,0,0,,I noticed right after the match,
