Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.20,0:04:53.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,我拼得很狠
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.04,0:04:57.28,EN,,0,0,0,,I am as tired as one can be at this stage.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.04,0:04:57.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,这个阶段能有多累我就有多累
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.28,0:05:00.16,EN,,0,0,0,,You can imagine a lot of matches, but um,
