Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.04,0:05:36.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.16,0:05:38.24,EN,,0,0,0,,I think it's I guess it's been pretty effective
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.16,0:05:38.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,我觉得它挺管用
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.24,0:05:39.92,EN,,0,0,0,,because I've been doing pretty well.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.24,0:05:39.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,因为我这段打得还不错
