Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.84,0:05:43.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,只是我众多武器里
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.92,0:05:45.36,EN,,0,0,0,,that I have.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.92,0:05:45.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,的其中一个
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.36,0:05:46.08,EN,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.36,0:05:46.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.08,0:05:47.12,EN,,0,0,0,,Alex, I'm just wondering how
