Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.40,0:05:59.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,随着赛事往下打
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.04,0:06:02.48,EN,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Um I kind of rolled my ankle
