Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.20,0:06:18.16,EN,,0,0,0,,you know." Um cuz it happened so fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.20,0:06:18.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,因为一切发生得太快了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.16,0:06:19.92,EN,,0,0,0,,But luckily there's there's nothing wrong
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.16,0:06:19.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,但还好没什么大问题
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.92,0:06:20.56,EN,,0,0,0,,with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.92,0:06:20.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,没事
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.56,0:06:21.92,EN,,0,0,0,,Um and it
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.56,0:06:21.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,而且
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.92,0:06:25.44,EN,,0,0,0,,was no no serious no serious problems
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.92,0:06:25.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,不是什么严重的问题
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.44,0:06:28.72,EN,,0,0,0,,but I mean uh yeah today
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.44,0:06:28.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,不过今天
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.72,0:06:31.60,EN,,0,0,0,,was physically it pushed me a lot and I
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.72,0:06:31.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,身体上真的很拼
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.60,0:06:34.40,EN,,0,0,0,,have a lot of matches in my in you know
