Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.88,0:06:38.96,EN,,0,0,0,,and bad and you know I think this is also
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.88,0:06:38.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,也有代价 我觉得这也是
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.96,0:06:42.00,EN,,0,0,0,,a learning process there um you know
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.96,0:06:42.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,一个学习的过程
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.00,0:06:43.52,EN,,0,0,0,,we're athletes so that's kind
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.00,0:06:43.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,我们是运动员
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.52,0:06:46.08,EN,,0,0,0,,of physical is it's like a huge part
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.52,0:06:46.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,身体状况本来就是
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.08,0:06:49.20,EN,,0,0,0,,of our job so um I think I
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.08,0:06:49.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,这份工作很大的一部分
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.20,0:06:50.32,EN,,0,0,0,,have a great team who's going
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.20,0:06:50.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,我有个很棒的团队
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.32,0:06:51.28,EN,,0,0,0,,to help me recover
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.32,0:06:51.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,会帮我恢复
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.28,0:06:53.60,EN,,0,0,0,,and and I have I have high hopes
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.28,0:06:53.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,我对接下来这站
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.60,0:06:57.64,EN,,0,0,0,,for for the rest of the tournament.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.60,0:06:57.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,也很有信心
