Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.60,0:07:04.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.40,0:07:05.92,EN,,0,0,0,,Oh, super excited.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.40,0:07:05.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,我特别期待
